date-released: "2026-11-14"
keywords:
  - NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026
  - MODIS
  - VIIRS
  - NASA FIRMS
  - active fire
  - harmonization
  - Bangladesh
abstract: >-
  A web app and Kaggle pipeline that puts NASA's MODIS and VIIRS active-fire
  detections on one fair scale, with a burning calendar, district maps and a
  live 3D Earth of today's hot spots. Built by Team Lumos (Dhaka) for the
  NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 "Harmonization of MODIS and VIIRS Hot Spots".
